==Strategy==
Due to the abundance of backline enemies, the recommended way to go about this stage is to use [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance]] and [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave units]] like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] while protecting your stack with [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Erasers]] and [[Cat (Normal Cat)|dual]] [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Machos]]. The stream of Baa Baas provide cash for them, and due to that one should be able to clear the stage somewhat quickly.

If you happen to have [[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Radiant Aphrodite]], this stage becomes a joke. She outranges even the Alpacky and deals Massive Damage to the aliens in the stage.

